{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/75e6cf922f589bdc90b6f75027bc13ab.poster.avif?t=1756812433\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/75e6cf922f589bdc90b6f75027bc13ab.webm?t=1756812433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/75e6cf922f589bdc90b6f75027bc13ab.mp4?t=1756812433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of arcade nostalgia where you manage and expand your own arcade, while collecting over 500 Gachas to trade and sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/91c178d4e1fa54a3b049686d23940774.poster.avif?t=1756812433\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/91c178d4e1fa54a3b049686d23940774.webm?t=1756812433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/91c178d4e1fa54a3b049686d23940774.mp4?t=1756812433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and customize your arcade with cabinets, gacha machines, and claw games, setting prices to strike the perfect balance between fun and profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/a744589b11b8aaccfe5e0cd24a79eeae.poster.avif?t=1756812433\" width=540 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/a744589b11b8aaccfe5e0cd24a79eeae.webm?t=1756812433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/a744589b11b8aaccfe5e0cd24a79eeae.mp4?t=1756812433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open over 500+ collectible Gachas yourself\u2014sell rare finds for huge profit or keep them to complete your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/4d91b017752fe0a9e3071ae59933fb08.poster.avif?t=1756812433\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/4d91b017752fe0a9e3071ae59933fb08.webm?t=1756812433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/4d91b017752fe0a9e3071ae59933fb08.mp4?t=1756812433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Count the tickets won by customers and exchange them for prizes to keep them coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/eaec30b5cf9bfb00bce3aace44222203.poster.avif?t=1756812433\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/eaec30b5cf9bfb00bce3aace44222203.webm?t=1756812433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/eaec30b5cf9bfb00bce3aace44222203.mp4?t=1756812433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest your profits to expand your arcade. Unlock advanced machines and create a one-of-a-kind arcade experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Arcade Management Simulator</strong>, every choice you make shapes your journey. Can you rise to the challenge and turn your humble arcade into the most legendary entertainment destination?<br><br>This is just the beginning we'll have more features added as development progresses.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3475040?t=1756812433","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3475040?t=1756812433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/ade8dec1bcc643d7815e0d175044d93133aa4422/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756812433","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/ade8dec1bcc643d7815e0d175044d93133aa4422/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756812433","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3601540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Demo Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/e534f2062b9152e0db0b92e2ba5d686c.avif?t=1756812433\" width=630 height=1381 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/75e6cf922f589bdc90b6f75027bc13ab.poster.avif?t=1756812